<title>CROATIA: Croatia Oct real wages index 108.8 vs Sept 107.3.</title>
<headline>Croatia Oct real wages index 108.8 vs Sept 107.3.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bureau of Statistics issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA NET WAGES		 OCT '96   SEPT '96    OCT '95</p>
<p> Real wage index (base 1995)    108.8	107.3	100.9</p>
<p> Nominal wages (HRK)		2,071	2,028	1,848</p>
<p>NOTE - October nominal wages in the goods and services sector rose to 2,056 kuna from September 2,005 kuna and to 2,114 from 2,093 kuna in the public sector.</p>
<p>-- Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
</text>
